        <h1 class="font-display font-bold text-3xl md:text-5xl mb-4">
          How to Move Into Older Historic Homes in Denver With Narrow Hallways and Staircases
        </h1>
        <p class="text-lg text-white/90">
          Denver's historic neighborhoods are some of the most sought-after in the city — and some of the most challenging to move into. Narrow stairwells, tight doorways, original hardwood floors, and limited street parking all require a different approach than a standard residential move. Here's the complete guide.
        </p>
